FILE_DESCRIPTION(
/* description */ (
'Splined insert for the elevation shaft bore. Straight-sided spline 12
 x 28.5 x 31.5, tooth width 3.5, mating the 12 x 29 x 32 hub in the sh
aft with 0.25 radial / 0.20 per flank clearance. Local origin on the o
utboard face, axis +X points into the shaft; 4 mm proud for the rest o
f the part.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

